title: Declaration
tags:
---
<<declare $completedOnboarding to false as bool>>
<<jump OnboardingStageOne>>

===
title: OnboardingStageOne
tags:
---
Welcome, You are about to embark on a journey through Silent Awakening. Before we begin, let us familiarize you with the basics of movement and interaction. #line:1 

To move, use the thumbstick on your left controller. Walk towards the glowing Green Circle ahead of you. Take your time. #line:2 

When ready, move forward. #line:3 

===
title: OnboardingStageTwo
tags:
---
<<setup_stage_two ScriptHandler>>

Excellent. Now, let’s practice turning. #line:4

Use the thumbstick on your right controller to turn your view and align yourself with the second glowing Green Circle behind you. Feel free to adjust until you are comfortable. #line:5

Proceed when ready. #line:6 

===
title: OnboardingStageThree
tags:
---
<<setup_stage_three ScriptHandler>>

Well done. Interaction is key in this experience. #line:7

Look to your left. You’ll find a table with objects resting upon it. Reach out with your hand and press the trigger button to pick up an object. Experiment by picking up and placing down a few items. #line:8

Once you are comfortable with the interactions and movement controls, proceed to the holographic circle in front of you to begin the experience. #line:9 


===
